    <system:String x:Key="Connection.AttachWindow.Warning" xml:space="preserve">Arknights PC Connection (Community-maintained)

Please note:
1. The MAA Team only provides the connection feature for the Arknights PC client; ongoing maintenance and bug fixes are left to the community, and availability is not guaranteed.
2. If you run into problems or unusable features, please open an issue on GitHub. Whether it gets resolved depends on whether a community developer is willing to follow up.
3. Other channels such as QQ groups or video comment sections cannot resolve Arknights PC connection issues, so please do not ask about them there.

If you don't strictly need it, we recommend using ADB to connect to an Android emulator or mobile device for a more stable experience.

If you do need to use it, please ensure:
1. MAA is launched with administrator privileges
2. It is recommended to add a Link start/stop hotkey in Settings → Hotkey Settings, in case the Stop button cannot be clicked
3. For some screencap methods, the game window cannot be minimized
4. Arknights Settings → Game → UI Scaling is set to 100%
5. Lower the mouse pointer scale in Arknights settings to reduce obstruction of recognition areas
6. Game resolution must be 16:9; recommended settings: 1280x720 or 1920x1080</system:String>
    <system:String x:Key="Connection.AttachWindow.WarningRecommendation" xml:space="preserve">7. We recommend using PostMsg-WindowPos as the mouse input method; it can greatly reduce recognition errors and freezing issues on the PC client</system:String>
