1. {key=Roguelike.Squad.IS2NewSquad3} is recommended when your box has many strong 6★ operators
2. When difficulty ≥ N4, 6★ Hope cost +1; some squads may be unable to recruit a 6★ operator at the start, which can cause errors or failures</system:String>
