    <system:String x:Key="Settings.Update.Source.Tip" xml:space="preserve">
🌏 Using {key=Settings.Update.Source.Global}:
    • {key=Settings.Update.CheckNow}: Update checks are provided by the MAA Team, with update packages pulled from GitHub. A direct domestic mirror is also available (limited bandwidth during peak hours)
    • {key=Settings.Update.ResourceUpdate}: Free update checks provided by {key=Settings.Update.Source.MirrorChyan}. You can manually click "{key=Settings.Update.ResourceUpdate}" in Settings to download from GitHub

🔑 Using {key=Settings.Update.Source.MirrorChyan}:
    • After entering a CDK, automatic updates for both software and resources are enabled
    • Downloads are prioritized via the high-speed {key=Settings.Update.Source.MirrorChyan} CDN for greater stability and speed

📦 Manual Update:
    • {key=Settings.Update.CheckNow}: Download a full package or OTA update package and drag it into the app. The app will automatically extract it and clean up old files
    • {key=Settings.Update.ResourceUpdate}: Download the resource package and overwrite the `resource` folder. The package is incremental; do not delete the original folder, or errors may occur

📄 Update Notes:
    • {key=Settings.Update.CheckNow}: Includes UI and feature updates. All interface changes and new features are delivered via {key=Settings.Update.CheckNow}
    • {key=Settings.Update.ResourceUpdate}: Includes new stage maps for Auto Battle, drop item icons for recognition, recruitment tags for operator recognition, and other resource data
    • Navigation Hotfix: Triggered automatically to update main screen prompts and event stage entries. A success message “{key=VersionUpdate.Api.UpdateSuccess}” will appear in the top right corner
</system:String>
