    <system:String x:Key="TaskQueue.Fight.Series.Tip" xml:space="preserve">• AUTO:
Automatically identify the maximum proxy multiplier of the level, maintain the maximum proxy multiplier and do not overflow sanity after using sanity potion

• Value (1~10):
Execute proxy according to the set multiplier
If the current sanity is not enough to complete the set multiplier (such as only enough for 5 times but set to 6 times), you cannot enter the battle
Or
If the number of battles is not enough to complete the set multiplier (such as only enough for 5 times but set to 6 times), you will not be able to enter the battle

• {key=TaskQueue.NotSwitch}:
Do not adjust the proxy multiplier setting in the game</system:String>
