• {key=TaskQueue.Fight.Quantity}: uses the selected material's drop count in this combat task as the target, and stops when the set amount is reached.
• {key=TaskQueue.Fight.TargetInventory}: uses the saved inventory data from ｢{key=Toolbox.Title}-{key=Depot.Title}｣ and only farms until the target stock is reached.
